        "simple": "If you have two guitars and you pluck a string on one, the same string on the other guitar will start to wiggle too. This happens because they are tuned to the same note and the air carries the message between them. People work just like those guitars. When you are feeling very happy or very kind, you naturally start to wiggle with other people who feel the same way. This invisible pull brings together people who are singing the same internal song.",
